heat-phobic.&nbsp;</p><p>With the worst outbreaks occurring in the northern, temperate zones currently experiencing wintry 0~10C degree temperatures.</p><p></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G1Hy!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e7bd53f-5b1f-456c-8b7a-baf1cbab0139_616x448.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G1Hy!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e7bd53f-5b1f-456c-8b7a-baf1cbab0139_616x448.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G1Hy!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e7bd53f-5b1f-456c-8b7a-baf1cbab0139_616x448.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G1Hy!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e7bd53f-5b1f-456c-8b7a-baf1cbab0139_616x448.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G1Hy!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e7bd53f-5b1f-456c-8b7a-baf1cbab0139_616x448.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G1Hy!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e7bd53f-5b1f-456c-8b7a-baf1cbab0139_616x448.png\" width=\"616\" height=\"448\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://b